# The committed acceptance reports are byte-compared against a fresh render by
# tests/unit/test_tripwire_acceptance_report_sync.py, `fr acceptance report
# --check`, and `fr acceptance check`. Pin them to LF so a CRLF checkout
# (core.autocrlf) can never make the byte comparison false-fail.
docs/acceptance/report_local.html text eol=lf
docs/acceptance/report_linked.html text eol=lf
docs/acceptance/report_linked.md text eol=lf
